WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.399
It helps to see the whole routine at once,

2
00:00:02.399 --> 00:00:05.175
because each phase depends
on the one before it.

3
00:00:05.175 --> 00:00:08.215
Before the meeting, you
set it up: the purpose,

4
00:00:08.215 --> 00:00:11.087
the agenda, the roles
and the right people.

5
00:00:11.087 --> 00:00:16.825
During it, you run it: on time, on the
agenda, with anything off-topic parked.

6
00:00:16.825 --> 00:00:20.478
After it, you follow through:
written notes the same day,

7
00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:23.400
and every action with an
owner and a due date.

8
00:00:23.400 --> 00:00:25.675
The part to notice is the arrow back.

9
00:00:25.675 --> 00:00:30.725
What comes out of one meeting opens the next
one's agenda, so nothing quietly drops.

10
00:00:30.725 --> 00:00:34.900
But there's a question that comes before
all of this: do you need a meeting at all?
